04289 // This is less wide than RenderArrow() and we use in dock nodes instead of the regular RenderArrow() to denote a change of functionality,
04290 // and because the saved space means that the left-most tab label can stay at exactly the same position as the label of a loose window.
04291 void ImGui::RenderArrowDockMenu(ImDrawList* draw_list, ImVec2 p_min, float sz, ImU32 col)
04292 {
